 "text": {
  "fr": {
   "name": "P.O.W. : Prisoners of War",
   "genre": "Beat'em All",
   "synopsis": "P.O.W. : Prisoners of War sur NES est un jeu d'action qui vous amène à incarner un prisonnier de guerre dans sa fuite du camp d'emprisonnement. Vous aurez à votre disposition nombre d'armes et d'attaques de mêlée pour y parvenir.",
   "synopsis_lang": "fr"
  },
  "en": {
   "name": "P.O.W. : Prisoners of War",
   "genre": "Beat'em Up",
   "synopsis": "The enemy is unstoppable. They maintain vigilant guard over their front lines! The only way to defeat them is to get behind their lines. But how? By allowing a soldier to get captured, perhaps he could escape and single-handedly defeat the enemy forces in his way. \n\nIn P.O.W., the player is a soldier who has been imprisoned in a Prisoner of War camp and must escape. In order to accomplish this, he must defeat a variety of enemies.  The foes will attack you hand-to-hand, with knives, guns, and from helicopters. Boss enemies will guard the end of each level.\n\nTo fight back, you can use hand-to-hand, and pick up weapon power-ups, found on the ground, in rooms, or dropped by enemies. These weapons include a knife, which can be used to stab or be thrown, guns and grenades.",
   "synopsis_lang": "en"
  }
 },
